        <description>&lt;p&gt;Internet status alerts, smoother activity replacement, preserved settings, and a cleaner interface.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Separate offline and online alerts, with an optional always-visible offline status.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Brief alerts replace the top status; long-running activities can use lower pills.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A proper Bluetooth icon and one AirPods connection alert.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Smaller app and fewer unnecessary network checks during connection changes.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item>
